{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38644","headline":"山居即事二首 二 · 陆希声","name":"山居即事二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不是幽栖矫性灵，从来无意在羶腥。\n满川风物供高枕，四合云山借画屏。\n五鹿归来惊岳岳，孤鸿飞去入冥冥。\n君阳遁叟何爲乐，一炷清香两卷经。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆希声","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}